\cell}
{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 Hard ceiling of bits in ONE frame. Must be >= average and <= 6144*channels (otherwise clamped). Reasonable cap ~1.5x average (~4500 for 128k st.). Too low = starves loud frames (audible).\par}
\cell}
