\cell}
{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 -1 (off)\par}
\cell}
{{\pard\intbl \ql \f0 \sa0 \li0 \fi0 Scales the spreading of masking between bands. {\f1 <256} = LESS masking = more detail (equivalent to loosening tone-masks-noise). Biggest effect where bits are limited (96-192k). 256=no change. Combine with {\f1 --ath-scale <256}.\par}
\cell}
